    "NHS breast screening is a national programme that invites women from age 50 until their 71st birthday for a **free mammogram** every three years. [2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) Every scan is double-read by **two trained readers independently** within the NHS Breast Screening Programme. [3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) When conclusions differ, the case goes to **arbitration** before a final decision is made.": "NHS 乳腺筛查是一项全国性项目，邀请 50 岁至 71 岁生日之前的女性每三年做一次**免费乳腺 X 光检查**。[2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) 在 NHS 乳腺筛查项目内，每一次扫描都由**两位受训阅片者独立**双阅。[3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) 当结论不一致时，病例会在最终决定前进入**仲裁**。",
