    "Breast screening teams were already working **under pressure**. With **millions of women screened** each year and a **growing consultant radiologist shortage**, AI entered the workflow as a possible **second reader** — a way to reduce workload while preserving the **double-read standard**. [4](https://digital.nhs.uk/data-and-information/publications/statistical/breast-screening-programme/england-2024-2025) [5](https://www.rcr.ac.uk/media/4imb5jge/_rcr-2024-clinical-radiology-workforce-census-report.pdf)": "乳腺筛查团队本就在**高压下工作**。每年有**数百万名女性接受筛查**，加上**顾问级放射科医生持续短缺**，AI 作为一个可能的**第二阅片者**进入了工作流——一种在保留**双阅标准**的同时减轻工作量的方式。[4](https://digital.nhs.uk/data-and-information/publications/statistical/breast-screening-programme/england-2024-2025) [5](https://www.rcr.ac.uk/media/4imb5jge/_rcr-2024-clinical-radiology-workforce-census-report.pdf)",
