    ". The panel expands only after submission: a lightweight intervention, not an interruption.": "。面板只在提交之后展开：是轻量干预，不是打断。",
    "Progressive disclosure": "渐进式披露",
    "Only **essential disagreement information** is visible by default. Detailed comparison, previous cases, and supporting evidence open in a **comparison modal** — one click away, not cluttering the default view.": "默认只显示**必要的分歧信息**。详细对比、既往病例和支持证据在一个**对比弹窗**中打开——只需一次点击，不会让默认视图变得杂乱。",
    "Only essential disagreement information is visible by default. Detailed comparison, previous cases, and supporting evidence open in a comparison modal — one click away, not cluttering the default view.": "默认只显示必要的分歧信息。详细对比、既往病例和支持证据在一个对比弹窗中打开——只需一次点击，不会让默认视图变得杂乱。",
    "Only": "默认只显示",
