    "Clinical visual language": "临床视觉语言",
    "The interface keeps the **dark appearance** used in existing PACS viewers to minimise distraction. **Red** remains the radiologist's annotation; **orange** represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.": "界面沿用现有 PACS 阅片器的**深色外观**以尽量减少干扰。**红色**仍是放射科医生的标注；**橙色**代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。",
    "The interface keeps the dark appearance used in existing PACS viewers to minimise distraction. Red remains the radiologist's annotation; orange represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.": "界面沿用现有 PACS 阅片器的深色外观以尽量减少干扰。红色仍是放射科医生的标注；橙色代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。",
