    "orange": "橙色",
    "represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.": "代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。",
    "Iterating for simplicity": "为简洁而迭代",
    "Several elements were **removed during iteration**, including an early workflow progress indicator — testing showed it distracted attention and implied unnecessary complexity. The final interface keeps only what **supports decision-making**.": "迭代过程中**移除了若干元素**，包括一个早期的工作流进度指示器——测试显示它分散注意力，并暗示了不必要的复杂度。最终界面只保留**支持决策**的部分。",
    "Several elements were removed during iteration, including an early workflow progress indicator — testing showed it distracted attention and implied unnecessary complexity. The final interface keeps only what supports decision-making.": "迭代过程中移除了若干元素，包括一个早期的工作流进度指示器——测试显示它分散注意力，并暗示了不必要的复杂度。最终界面只保留支持决策的部分。",
    "Several elements were": "迭代过程中",
    "removed during iteration": "移除了若干元素",
    ", including an early workflow progress indicator — testing showed it distracted attention and implied unnecessary complexity. The final interface keeps only what": "，包括一个早期的工作流进度指示器——测试显示它分散注意力，并暗示了不必要的复杂度。最终界面只保留",
    "supports decision-making": "支持决策",
    "The final prototype does **not replace** the radiologist's workflow. It introduces **one carefully positioned intervention** that makes AI–human disagreement **visible, discussable, and traceable** — while preserving clinical independence.": "最终原型**不取代**放射科医生的工作流。它引入**一个精心定位的干预**，让 AI 与人的分歧变得**可见、可讨论、可追溯**——同时保全临床独立性。",
    "The final prototype does not replace the radiologist's workflow. It introduces one carefully positioned intervention that makes AI–human disagreement visible, discussable, and traceable — while preserving clinical independence.": "最终原型不取代放射科医生的工作流。它引入一个精心定位的干预，让 AI 与人的分歧变得可见、可讨论、可追溯——同时保全临床独立性。",
    "The final prototype does": "最终原型",
    "not replace": "不取代",
    "the radiologist's workflow. It introduces": "放射科医生的工作流。它引入",
    "one carefully positioned intervention": "一个精心定位的干预",
    "that makes AI–human disagreement": "，让 AI 与人的分歧变得",
    "visible, discussable, and traceable": "可见、可讨论、可追溯",
    "— while preserving clinical independence.": "——同时保全临床独立性。",
    "02 · Arbitration View · Team": "02 · Arbitration View（仲裁视图）· 团队",
    "Disagreement evidence, structured for the consensus meeting.": "把分歧证据，为共识会议结构化。",
    "The Arbitration View responds to the escalation moment: when a flagged disagreement case enters team review before the final recall decision.": "Arbitration View 回应的是升级的那一刻：当一个被标记的分歧病例在最终召回决定前进入团队复核。",
    "It brings the human read, AI evidence, prior imaging, and reasoning record into one structured view, reducing cognitive load and hierarchy pressure. Developed as a team prototype.": "它把人的阅片结论、AI 证据、既往影像和推理记录汇入一个结构化视图，降低认知负荷和层级压力。作为团队原型开发。",
    "Arbitration View: structured evidence panel for the consensus meeting.": "Arbitration View：为共识会议准备的结构化证据面板。",
    "03 · Learning Hub · Team": "03 · Learning Hub（学习中心）· 团队",
    "Difficult cases become institutional learning material.": "困难病例成为机构的学习材料。",
    "The Learning Hub responds after the decision closes: turning difficult disagreement cases into reusable records for calibration, CPD, and protocol improvement.": "Learning Hub 在决定关闭之后起作用：把困难的分歧病例转化为可复用的记录，用于校准、CPD 和方案改进。",
    "Each disagreement case can become a reflection record, tagged by disagreement type and linked to CPD, team calibration, and protocol improvement. Developed as a team prototype.": "每个分歧病例都可以成为一份反思记录，按分歧类型打标签，并关联到 CPD、团队校准和方案改进。作为团队原型开发。",
    "Learning Hub: disagreement cases converted to reflection records and CPD material.": "Learning Hub：分歧病例转化为反思记录和 CPD 材料。"
