    "NHS 乳腺筛查依赖**独立双阅片**：每一张乳腺 X 光片都由两位放射科医生评估，出现分歧时先进入仲裁，再做出最终的召回决定。": "NHS breast screening relies on **independent double reading**: every mammogram is assessed by two radiologists, and disagreements go to arbitration before the final recall decision.",
