    "AI 如今正作为一个可能的第二阅片者进入这个工作流。但当 AI 与放射科医生得出不同结论时，工作流并没有清楚地定义这个分歧应当如何被": "AI is now entering this workflow as a possible second reader. But when AI and the radiologist reach different conclusions, the workflow does not clearly define how that disagreement should be",
