    "超越 AI 的准确率": "Beyond AI Accuracy",
    "关于 AI 在乳腺筛查中的讨论，大多聚焦于模型有多**准**。我们更关心一件更贴近人的事：**人与 AI 如何协作**——尤其是在他们意见不合的时刻。": "Most conversations about AI in breast screening focus on how **accurate** the model is. We were more interested in something more human: how **people and AI work together** — especially in the moments they disagree.",
