    "让更好的判断与协作得以发生的条件": "conditions for better judgement and collaboration",
    "——是支持，不是替代——并且，正如展览所清楚显示的，是和会使用它的人一起做设计，而不只是为他们做设计。": "— support, not replacement — and, as the exhibition made clear, designing with the people who would use it, not only for them.",
