    "什么是乳腺癌筛查": "What is breast cancer screening",
    "什么是乳腺癌筛查？": "What is breast cancer screening?",
    "乳腺癌是英国女性最常见的癌症——每年约有 **59,000** 名女性被确诊。[1](https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/health-professional/cancer-statistics/statistics-by-cancer-type/breast-cancer) 早发现，**大多数女性能够存活**。晚发现，临床后果则更难处理。这就是为什么**每一次阅片都重要**。": "Breast cancer is the most common cancer in UK women — around **59,000** women are diagnosed each year. [1](https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/health-professional/cancer-statistics/statistics-by-cancer-type/breast-cancer) Find it early, and **most women survive**. Find it late, and the clinical consequences are harder. That is why **every read matters**.",
    "乳腺癌是英国女性最常见的癌症——每年约有 59,000 名女性被确诊。1 早发现，大多数女性能够存活。晚发现，临床后果则更难处理。这就是为什么每一次阅片都重要。": "Breast cancer is the most common cancer in UK women — around 59,000 women are diagnosed each year. 1 Find it early, and most women survive. Find it late, and the clinical consequences are harder. That is why every read matters.",
    "乳腺癌是英国女性最常见的癌症——每年约有": "Breast cancer is the most common cancer in UK women — around",
    "名女性被确诊。[1](https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/health-professional/cancer-statistics/statistics-by-cancer-type/breast-cancer) 早发现，": "women are diagnosed each year. [1](https://www.cancerresearchuk.org/health-professional/cancer-statistics/statistics-by-cancer-type/breast-cancer) Find it early, and",
    "大多数女性能够存活": "most women survive",
    "。晚发现，临床后果则更难处理。这就是为什么": ". Find it late, and the clinical consequences are harder. That is why",
    "每一次阅片都重要": "every read matters",
    "NHS 乳腺筛查是一项全国性项目，邀请 50 岁至 71 岁生日之前的女性每三年做一次**免费乳腺 X 光检查**。[2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) 在 NHS 乳腺筛查项目内，每一次扫描都由**两位受训阅片者独立**双阅。[3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) 当结论不一致时，病例会在最终决定前进入**仲裁**。": "NHS breast screening is a national programme that invites women from age 50 until their 71st birthday for a **free mammogram** every three years. [2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) Every scan is double-read by **two trained readers independently** within the NHS Breast Screening Programme. [3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) When conclusions differ, the case goes to **arbitration** before a final decision is made.",
    "NHS 乳腺筛查是一项全国性项目，邀请 50 岁至 71 岁生日之前的女性每三年做一次免费乳腺 X 光检查。2 在 NHS 乳腺筛查项目内，每一次扫描都由两位受训阅片者独立双阅。3 当结论不一致时，病例会在最终决定前进入仲裁。": "NHS breast screening is a national programme that invites women from age 50 until their 71st birthday for a free mammogram every three years. 2 Every scan is double-read by two trained readers independently within the NHS Breast Screening Programme. 3 When conclusions differ, the case goes to arbitration before a final decision is made.",
    "NHS 乳腺筛查是一项全国性项目，邀请 50 岁至 71 岁生日之前的女性每三年做一次": "NHS breast screening is a national programme that invites women from age 50 until their 71st birthday for a",
    "免费乳腺 X 光检查": "free mammogram",
    "。[2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) 在 NHS 乳腺筛查项目内，每一次扫描都由": "every three years. [2](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-helping-women-decide/nhs-breast-screening-helping-you-decide) Every scan is double-read by",
    "两位受训阅片者独立": "two trained readers independently",
    "双阅。[3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) 当结论不一致时，病例会在最终决定前进入": "within the NHS Breast Screening Programme. [3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) When conclusions differ, the case goes to",
