    "放射科医生": "Radiologist",
    "身处一套信任系统之中的阅片者（放射科医生）。": "The reader (radiologist) inside a system of trust.",
    "AI 为何进入": "Why AI entered",
    "AI 为何进入——以及它留下了什么未解。": "Why AI entered — and what it left unresolved.",
    "乳腺筛查团队本就在**高压下工作**。每年有**数百万名女性接受筛查**，加上**顾问级放射科医生持续短缺**，AI 作为一个可能的**第二阅片者**进入了工作流——一种在保留**双阅标准**的同时减轻工作量的方式。[4](https://digital.nhs.uk/data-and-information/publications/statistical/breast-screening-programme/england-2024-2025) [5](https://www.rcr.ac.uk/media/4imb5jge/_rcr-2024-clinical-radiology-workforce-census-report.pdf)": "Breast screening teams were already working **under pressure**. With **millions of women screened** each year and a **growing consultant radiologist shortage**, AI entered the workflow as a possible **second reader** — a way to reduce workload while preserving the **double-read standard**. [4](https://digital.nhs.uk/data-and-information/publications/statistical/breast-screening-programme/england-2024-2025) [5](https://www.rcr.ac.uk/media/4imb5jge/_rcr-2024-clinical-radiology-workforce-census-report.pdf)",
    "乳腺筛查团队本就在高压下工作。每年有数百万名女性接受筛查，加上顾问级放射科医生持续短缺，AI 作为一个可能的第二阅片者进入了工作流——一种在保留双阅标准的同时减轻工作量的方式。4 5": "Breast screening teams were already working under pressure. With millions of women screened each year and a growing consultant radiologist shortage, AI entered the workflow as a possible second reader — a way to reduce workload while preserving the double-read standard. 4 5",
