    "PRAIM 真实世界研究，463,094 名女性接受筛查。8": "PRAIM real-world study with 463,094 women screened. 8",
    "这些例子支持把 AI 作为第二阅片者。尚未解决的问题是操作层面的：当 AI 与放射科医生分歧时，**这个差异应当如何处理？**": "These examples support AI as a second reader. The unresolved question is operational: when AI and a radiologist disagree, **how should that difference be handled?**",
    "这些例子支持把 AI 作为第二阅片者。尚未解决的问题是操作层面的：当 AI 与放射科医生分歧时，这个差异应当如何处理？": "These examples support AI as a second reader. The unresolved question is operational: when AI and a radiologist disagree, how should that difference be handled?",
    "这些例子支持把 AI 作为第二阅片者。尚未解决的问题是操作层面的：当 AI 与放射科医生分歧时，": "These examples support AI as a second reader. The unresolved question is operational: when AI and a radiologist disagree,",
    "这个差异应当如何处理？": "how should that difference be handled?",
    "焦点如何浮现": "How the focus emerged",
    "在公众访谈、已发表的证据、工作流模型和专家咨询之间，同一个未解的时刻反复出现：AI 和放射科医生可能得出不同结论，但工作流并没有清楚地定义接下来应该发生什么。": "Across public interviews, published evidence, workflow models, and expert consultations, the same unresolved moment kept appearing: AI and the radiologist could reach different conclusions, but the workflow did not clearly define what should happen next.",
    "分歧的那一刻": "The disagreement moment",
    "研究证据": "Research evidence",
    "研究证据。": "Research evidence.",
    "我们从专家意见、公众陈述、工作流模型和已发表来源等多方面检视了证据。": "We examined evidence across expert input, public accounts, workflow models, and published sources.",
    "公众访谈": "Public interviews",
    "公众的信任与期待": "Public trust and expectations",
    "已发表来源": "Published sources",
    "性能证据 vs. 治理缺口": "Performance evidence vs. governance gap",
    "AI 工作流模型": "AI workflow models",
    "四种模式，一个缺失的步骤": "Four patterns, one missing step",
    "专家咨询": "Expert consultations",
    "临床与治理层面的验证": "Clinical and governance validation",
    "与处于乳腺筛查年龄段的女性进行了 20 多次面对面交流。聚焦于围绕 AI 辅助诊断的**信任、解释和决策**。": "20+ in-person conversations with women in the breast screening age range. Focused on **trust, explanation, and decision-making** around AI-assisted diagnosis.",
    "与处于乳腺筛查年龄段的女性进行了 20 多次面对面交流。聚焦于围绕 AI 辅助诊断的信任、解释和决策。": "20+ in-person conversations with women in the breast screening age range. Focused on trust, explanation, and decision-making around AI-assisted diagnosis.",
    "与处于乳腺筛查年龄段的女性进行了 20 多次面对面交流。聚焦于围绕 AI 辅助诊断的": "20+ in-person conversations with women in the breast screening age range. Focused on",
    "信任、解释和决策": "trust, explanation, and decision-making",
    "关键发现": "Key finding",
    "患者和公众并不期待 AI 的分歧被当作不确定性抛回给他们。他们期待临床系统有**一条清晰的责任与最终判断路径**。": "Patients and the public did not expect AI disagreement to be passed back to them as uncertainty. They expected the clinical system to have **a clear route for responsibility and final judgement**.",
    "患者和公众并不期待 AI 的分歧被当作不确定性抛回给他们。他们期待临床系统有一条清晰的责任与最终判断路径。": "Patients and the public did not expect AI disagreement to be passed back to them as uncertainty. They expected the clinical system to have a clear route for responsibility and final judgement.",
    "患者和公众并不期待 AI 的分歧被当作不确定性抛回给他们。他们期待临床系统有": "Patients and the public did not expect AI disagreement to be passed back to them as uncertainty. They expected the clinical system to have",
    "一条清晰的责任与最终判断路径": "a clear route for responsibility and final judgement",
    "回顾了 30 多篇学术论文、NHS 政策文件和临床指南——涵盖 AI 性能证据、筛查项目治理，以及临床 AI 部署中的**问责框架**。[3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) [8](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-03408-6) [9](https://doi.org/10.1177/09691413241262960)": "30+ academic papers, NHS policy documents, and clinical guidelines reviewed — spanning AI performance evidence, screening programme governance, and **accountability frameworks** in clinical AI deployment. [3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) [8](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-03408-6) [9](https://doi.org/10.1177/09691413241262960)",
    "回顾了 30 多篇学术论文、NHS 政策文件和临床指南——涵盖 AI 性能证据、筛查项目治理，以及临床 AI 部署中的问责框架。3 8 9": "30+ academic papers, NHS policy documents, and clinical guidelines reviewed — spanning AI performance evidence, screening programme governance, and accountability frameworks in clinical AI deployment. 3 8 9",
    "回顾了 30 多篇学术论文、NHS 政策文件和临床指南——涵盖 AI 性能证据、筛查项目治理，以及临床 AI 部署中的": "30+ academic papers, NHS policy documents, and clinical guidelines reviewed — spanning AI performance evidence, screening programme governance, and",
    "问责框架": "accountability frameworks",
    "。[3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) [8](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-03408-6) [9](https://doi.org/10.1177/09691413241262960)": "in clinical AI deployment. [3](https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading/breast-screening-guidance-for-image-reading) [8](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41591-024-03408-6) [9](https://doi.org/10.1177/09691413241262960)",
    "大多数来源讨论的是 **AI 性能、验证或实施就绪度**。较少有来源谈及分歧应当**在临床使用的那一刻**如何被治理。": "Most sources discussed **AI performance, validation, or implementation readiness**. Fewer addressed how disagreement should be governed **in the moment of clinical use**.",
    "大多数来源讨论的是 AI 性能、验证或实施就绪度。较少有来源谈及分歧应当在临床使用的那一刻如何被治理。": "Most sources discussed AI performance, validation, or implementation readiness. Fewer addressed how disagreement should be governed in the moment of clinical use.",
