    "原型": "Prototype",
    "这条原则被内建进一个真实乳腺 X 光阅片工作流的可运行原型中。它唯一引入的，是当放射科医生的阅片结论与 AI 不一致时的**一个轻量提示**——而不是对工作流的打断。": "This principle is built into a working prototype of a real mammography reading workflow. The only thing it introduces is a **lightweight prompt** when the radiologist's read and the AI's disagree — not a workflow interruption.",
    "这条原则被内建进一个真实乳腺 X 光阅片工作流的可运行原型中。它唯一引入的，是当放射科医生的阅片结论与 AI 不一致时的一个轻量提示——而不是对工作流的打断。": "This principle is built into a working prototype of a real mammography reading workflow. The only thing it introduces is a lightweight prompt when the radiologist's read and the AI's disagree — not a workflow interruption.",
    "这条原则被内建进一个真实乳腺 X 光阅片工作流的可运行原型中。它唯一引入的，是当放射科医生的阅片结论与 AI 不一致时的": "This principle is built into a working prototype of a real mammography reading workflow. The only thing it introduces is a",
    "一个轻量提示": "lightweight prompt",
    "——而不是对工作流的打断。": "when the radiologist's read and the AI's disagree — not a workflow interruption.",
    "Reading View 原型：放射科医生先阅片，AI 结果随后揭示，分歧以结构化提示的形式浮现。": "Reading View prototype: radiologist reads first, AI output revealed after, disagreement surfaced as a structured prompt.",
    "关键设计决策": "Key design decisions",
    "设计原则": "Design principles",
    "实现决策": "Implementation decisions",
    "人的判断在先": "Human judgement first",
    "**AI 结果只在**放射科医生提交自己的评估**之后才揭示**——在保全独立判断的同时，防止锚定效应和自动化偏差。": "**AI results are revealed only after** the radiologist submits their own assessment — preventing anchoring and automation bias while preserving independent judgement.",
    "AI 结果只在放射科医生提交自己的评估之后才揭示——在保全独立判断的同时，防止锚定效应和自动化偏差。": "AI results are revealed only after the radiologist submits their own assessment — preventing anchoring and automation bias while preserving independent judgement.",
    "基于真实临床软件搭建": "Built from real clinical software",
    "原型没有另造一个新的阅片器，而是**基于现有的乳腺 X 光系统**，工作流对标 **DetectedX** 等商用阅片器。只新引入了分歧支持这一层。": "Rather than inventing a new viewer, the prototype was **based on existing mammography systems**, with the workflow benchmarked against platforms like **DetectedX** and other commercial viewers. Only the disagreement support layer was introduced.",
    "原型没有另造一个新的阅片器，而是基于现有的乳腺 X 光系统，工作流对标 DetectedX 等商用阅片器。只新引入了分歧支持这一层。": "Rather than inventing a new viewer, the prototype was based on existing mammography systems, with the workflow benchmarked against platforms like DetectedX and other commercial viewers. Only the disagreement support layer was introduced.",
    "原型没有另造一个新的阅片器，而是": "Rather than inventing a new viewer, the prototype was",
