    "等商用阅片器。只新引入了分歧支持这一层。": "and other commercial viewers. Only the disagreement support layer was introduced.",
    "内嵌侧边面板": "Embedded side panel",
    "分歧信息出现在**侧边面板**里，而不是弹窗或抽屉——乳腺 X 光片**从不被遮挡**。面板只在提交之后展开：是轻量干预，不是打断。": "Disagreement information appears in a **side panel**, not a modal or drawer — the mammogram is **never obscured**. The panel expands only after submission: a lightweight intervention, not an interruption.",
    "分歧信息出现在侧边面板里，而不是弹窗或抽屉——乳腺 X 光片从不被遮挡。面板只在提交之后展开：是轻量干预，不是打断。": "Disagreement information appears in a side panel, not a modal or drawer — the mammogram is never obscured. The panel expands only after submission: a lightweight intervention, not an interruption.",
