    "临床视觉语言": "Clinical visual language",
    "界面沿用现有 PACS 阅片器的**深色外观**以尽量减少干扰。**红色**仍是放射科医生的标注；**橙色**代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。": "The interface keeps the **dark appearance** used in existing PACS viewers to minimise distraction. **Red** remains the radiologist's annotation; **orange** represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.",
    "界面沿用现有 PACS 阅片器的深色外观以尽量减少干扰。红色仍是放射科医生的标注；橙色代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。": "The interface keeps the dark appearance used in existing PACS viewers to minimise distraction. Red remains the radiologist's annotation; orange represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.",
    "界面沿用现有 PACS 阅片器的": "The interface keeps the",
    "深色外观": "dark appearance",
    "以尽量减少干扰。": "used in existing PACS viewers to minimise distraction.",
    "红色": "Red",
    "仍是放射科医生的标注；": "remains the radiologist's annotation;",
    "橙色": "orange",
    "代表 AI 的发现——颜色传达的是归属，而不是对注意力的争夺。": "represents AI findings — colour communicates ownership, not competition for attention.",
    "为简洁而迭代": "Iterating for simplicity",
    "迭代过程中**移除了若干元素**，包括一个早期的工作流进度指示器——测试显示它分散注意力，并暗示了不必要的复杂度。最终界面只保留**支持决策**的部分。": "Several elements were **removed during iteration**, including an early workflow progress indicator — testing showed it distracted attention and implied unnecessary complexity. The final interface keeps only what **supports decision-making**.",
    "迭代过程中移除了若干元素，包括一个早期的工作流进度指示器——测试显示它分散注意力，并暗示了不必要的复杂度。最终界面只保留支持决策的部分。": "Several elements were removed during iteration, including an early workflow progress indicator — testing showed it distracted attention and implied unnecessary complexity. The final interface keeps only what supports decision-making.",
    "迭代过程中": "Several elements were",
