    "——同时保全临床独立性。": "— while preserving clinical independence.",
    "02 · Arbitration View（仲裁视图）· 团队": "02 · Arbitration View · Team",
    "把分歧证据，为共识会议结构化。": "Disagreement evidence, structured for the consensus meeting.",
    "Arbitration View 回应的是升级的那一刻：当一个被标记的分歧病例在最终召回决定前进入团队复核。": "The Arbitration View responds to the escalation moment: when a flagged disagreement case enters team review before the final recall decision.",
    "它把人的阅片结论、AI 证据、既往影像和推理记录汇入一个结构化视图，降低认知负荷和层级压力。作为团队原型开发。": "It brings the human read, AI evidence, prior imaging, and reasoning record into one structured view, reducing cognitive load and hierarchy pressure. Developed as a team prototype.",
    "Arbitration View：为共识会议准备的结构化证据面板。": "Arbitration View: structured evidence panel for the consensus meeting.",
    "03 · Learning Hub（学习中心）· 团队": "03 · Learning Hub · Team",
    "困难病例成为机构的学习材料。": "Difficult cases become institutional learning material.",
    "Learning Hub 在决定关闭之后起作用：把困难的分歧病例转化为可复用的记录，用于校准、CPD 和方案改进。": "The Learning Hub responds after the decision closes: turning difficult disagreement cases into reusable records for calibration, CPD, and protocol improvement.",
    "每个分歧病例都可以成为一份反思记录，按分歧类型打标签，并关联到 CPD、团队校准和方案改进。作为团队原型开发。": "Each disagreement case can become a reflection record, tagged by disagreement type and linked to CPD, team calibration, and protocol improvement. Developed as a team prototype.",
    "Learning Hub：分歧病例转化为反思记录和 CPD 材料。": "Learning Hub: disagreement cases converted to reflection records and CPD material."
